ble digital and analog water sensors together in a multichannel controller with a clear display and menu navigation. Configurable outputs, relays and communication options support process integration, while an output-hold function assists with sensor maintenance.","featured",{"_57":163,"_247":-5,"_241":109,"_146":-5,"_143":248},"brand",{"_103":109,"_146":-5,"_148":-5,"_149":150},"heroImage",{"_159":251,"_139":171,"_172":252,"_174":253,"_176":254,"_178":255,"_180":256,"_182":257,"_184":258,"_186":259,"_188":260},"d84d4b36-8577-47f5-a6b1-91a7ae3a7c9f","2025040855746689.png","image/png",749999,"8032374cce79b2ec8e8e37dca3798c3058050655937edfc7f06654e8d4ff5b9e",1280,1706,"/igenu-preview/media/8032374cce79b2ec8e8e37dc.png","2026-10-20T17:32:39.748Z",[261,264,267,269],{"_180":191,"_182":262,"_174":193,"_184":263},427,"/igenu-preview/media/c82ee037d25142ee99b2efed.webp",{"_180":196,"_182":265,"_174":193,"_184":266},853,"/igenu-preview/media/8aafd5be554a54bb0699b6bf.webp",{"_180":200,"_182":256,"_174":193,"_184":268},"/igenu-preview/media/4a8ece2b232c4eb15009de8a.webp",{"_180":256,"_182":257,"_174":193,"_184":270},"/igenu-preview/media/288701302fcf6e887f187cad.webp",{"_159":208,"_57":272,"_239":273,"_241":274,"_243":275,"_245":150,"_162":276,"_249":278},"ig30phs","IG30PHS","IG30PHS Digital pH Electrode","Digital pH measurement combines a gel-filled electrode, double-junction reference and integrated temperature sensing. Modbus communication supports connection to compatible controllers, while calibration options and the supplied mounting bracket and flow cell support installation and routine operation.",{"_57":163,"_247":-5,"_241":109,"_146":-5,"_143":277},{"_103":109,"_146":-5,"_148":-5,"_149":150},{"_159":279,"_139":171,"_172":280,"_174":175,"_176":281,"_178":282,"_180":283,"_182":284,"_184":285,"_186":286,"_188":287},"7507b7cd-7dc3-42b2-90a4-f843106d4461","2025040859520101.png",19079,"7dfe5452c927d26232963ff85f11073f15b9d29010abcb394bea3ce0f2f502d6",358,302,"/igenu-previe